# Documentation backups and temporary files
*.backup
*.bak
*.tmp

# Scratch/analysis markdown artifacts agents drop ad hoc (planning notes,
# one-off audit summaries) — real docs belong under docs/ and get committed
# deliberately, not left to accumulate at the repo root.
*.scratch.md
*.notes.md
SCRATCH_*.md

